{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19101490","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19101490","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1910149001:0":{"text":"손님 여러분, 이건...","source_cn":"两位客人，这些是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB04FC8B82B6DFCF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910149002:0":{"text":"不关<style=stress><player_nam...","source_cn":"不关<style=stress><player_nam...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910149003:0":{"text":"你们要是不爽，就罚咱一个人，要骂要打，还是要把咱赶走，...","source_cn":"你们要是不爽，就罚咱一个人，要骂要打，还是要把咱赶走，...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910149004:1":{"text":"反正别找<male>他</male><female>她...","source_cn":"反正别找<male>他</male><female>她...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910149005:1":{"text":"嗯……你说什么？啊，我想起来了，是你白天说的“陆地分配...","source_cn":"嗯……你说什么？啊，我想起来了，是你白天说的“陆地分配...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910149006:1":{"text":"哎呀，真抱歉，我差点把这件事给忘了……本来还想多问你们...","source_cn":"哎呀，真抱歉，我差点把这件事给忘了……本来还想多问你们...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910149007:1":{"text":"모린 언니, 그게...","source_cn":"沫霖姐姐，是这样的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EEB7A34BD81DB5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:8:1910149008:1":{"text":"","source_cn":"","status":"no_source_text","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910149009:1":{"text":"그렇구나. 육지의 방식은 우리 바다 일족이랑 많이 다르네.","source_cn":"原来这是陆地的习惯，和海裔有很大差异呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18FAC8881E723945","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910149010:1":{"text":"알았어. 내일 아침에 할머니께 말씀드릴 테니까 다시 사냥을 나가자.","source_cn":"我知道了，明天早上我和阿嬷说一声，我们再出去围猎一次。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CA4996C461C73FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910149011:1":{"text":"응! 별일 없으면 우리는 이만 갈게. 너희도 일찍 쉬어.","source_cn":"嗯！既然没什么事，那我们先告辞了，你们也早点休息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA898DEE84CDA836","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910149012:1":{"text":"...야, 잠깐. 진짜... 이렇게 간다고?","source_cn":"……喂，等一下！你……你们就这么走了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x628FFF9944C12728","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910149013:1":{"text":"嗯？需要我们帮忙整理这些资源吗？","source_cn":"嗯？需要我们帮忙整理这些资源吗？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xB0FE356BBF25F605","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910149014:1":{"text":"그 얘기가 아니잖아!","source_cn":"咱不是说这个！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD71799AF991F532","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910149015:1":{"text":"화... 안 나? 나한테 욕 안 해?","source_cn":"你们……难道就不生气？不想骂咱？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE623678445ACDC38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910149016:1":{"text":"너희는 내 친구잖아. 내가 왜 화를 내고 욕을 해?","source_cn":"你们是我的朋友呀，我为什么要生气，要骂你们？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5850604891C0E205","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docu